# Never commit locally written uploads — object storage is S3-only.
# Anchored with a leading slash: a bare `uploads/` also matches
# src/modules/uploads/, which kept the whole module out of the repo and broke
# the Docker build with "Cannot find module '@/modules/uploads/uploads.module'".
/uploads/
